&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#201;cole&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Transmutation.html&quot; title=&quot;Transmutation&quot;&gt;Transmutation&lt;/a&gt;  [&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Cr&#233;er-Un-Sort.html#TERRE&quot; title=&quot;Cr&#233;er un sort&quot;&gt;terre&lt;/a&gt;] ; &lt;b&gt;Niveau&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Druide.html&quot; title=&quot;Le druide&quot;&gt;Dru&lt;/a&gt; 6, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Sorci&#232;re.html&quot; title=&quot;La sorci&#232;re&quot;&gt;Sor&lt;/a&gt; 6  
&lt;b&gt;Temps d&#39;incantation&lt;/b&gt; 1 &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Types-Dactions#Simple.html&quot; title=&quot;Action simple&quot;&gt;action simple&lt;/a&gt;  
&lt;b&gt;Composantes&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Composantes.html&quot; title=&quot;composantes&quot;&gt;V, G, FD&lt;/a&gt;  
&lt;b&gt;Port&#233;e&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts.html#PORTEE&quot; title=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation des sorts&quot;&gt;courte&lt;/a&gt; (7,5 m + 1,5 m/2 niveau)  
&lt;b&gt;Cible&lt;/b&gt; une cr&#233;ature ou un objet/&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vocabulaire-Courant#Niveau.html&quot; title=&quot;niveau&quot;&gt;niveau&lt;/a&gt;, il ne doit pas y avoir plus de 9 m&#232;tres entre deux cibles.  
&lt;b&gt;Dur&#233;e&lt;/b&gt; 1 &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vocabulaire-Courant#Round.html&quot; title=&quot;round&quot;&gt;round&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vocabulaire-Courant#Niveau.html&quot; title=&quot;niveau&quot;&gt;niveau&lt;/a&gt;  
&lt;b&gt;Jet de sauvegarde&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Jetdesauvegarde.html&quot; title=&quot;Vigueur&quot;&gt;Vigueur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts.html#JETSDESAUVEGARDE&quot; title=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation des sorts&quot;&gt;annule&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;b&gt;R&#233;sistance &#224; la magie&lt;/b&gt; oui
&lt;hr&gt;
Ce sort fonctionne comme &lt;i&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Entrave-De-Terre.html&quot; title=&quot;Entrave de terre&quot;&gt;entrave de terre&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, aux seules diff&#233;rences indiqu&#233;es ci-dessus.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Entrave de terre&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Entrave_de_terre_0&quot; href=&quot;#Entrave_de_terre_0&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;script&gt;
$(function () {
  let image = &quot;Illustrations/PNJ/Or&#233;ade.jpg&quot;;
  if(image == &quot;&quot; || image == &quot; &quot;) { $(&#39;.symbole2&#39;).html(&quot;&quot;); }
});
&lt;/script&gt;
